{"language":"cn","values":[["/names/cn","阿德"],["/description_i18n/cn","一名擅长持续作战的射手，能对对手造成持续伤害。"],["/unit_voice_lines/0/text_i18n/cn","又到了上工的时候了？"],["/unit_voice_lines/0/transcript_i18n/en","Ugh, time for work again?"],["/unit_voice_lines/0/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/1/text_i18n/cn","哇哦，没有涨薪水的升职。谢谢了。"],["/unit_voice_lines/1/transcript_i18n/en","Wow, a promotion! Without the salary increase! Thanks so much..."],["/unit_voice_lines/1/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/2/text_i18n/cn","嘿，尝尝这个！"],["/unit_voice_lines/2/transcript_i18n/en","Hey, try this! Hahahahah!"],["/unit_voice_lines/2/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/3/text_i18n/cn","失算了……"],["/unit_voice_lines/3/transcript_i18n/en","Didn't anticipate this, ugh..."],["/unit_voice_lines/3/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/4/text_i18n/cn","一点儿经验，加一点儿运气。"],["/unit_voice_lines/4/transcript_i18n/en","Mweheheh, a bit of experience, a bit of luck."],["/unit_voice_lines/4/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/5/text_i18n/cn","暗箭伤人有什么不好？多安全啊。"],["/unit_voice_lines/5/transcript_i18n/en","Hohohoh, what's wrong with a good sneak attack? As long as I'm safe!"],["/unit_voice_lines/5/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/resonating_hall_lines/0/transcript_i18n/cn","哦，日安，头儿。"],["/resonating_hall_lines/0/transcript_source_i18n/cn","manual"],["/resonating_hall_lines/1/transcript_i18n/cn","抓到了，舒服呀。"],["/resonating_hall_lines/1/transcript_source_i18n/cn","manual"],["/resonating_hall_lines/2/transcript_i18n/cn","安全，安全，还是安全。"],["/resonating_hall_lines/2/transcript_source_i18n/cn","manual"],["/affinity_gift_lines/0/text_i18n/cn","从哪里搞到的？真有你的！"],["/affinity_gift_lines/1/text_i18n/cn","喔，有趣的小玩意。"],["/skins/0/name_i18n/cn","蚀骨流箭"],["/skins/0/description_i18n/cn","漫不经心的吹箭，轻描淡写的毒液，不容小觑的危险。"],["/skins/1/name_i18n/cn","沙原斥候"],["/skins/1/description_i18n/cn","在这片残酷无情的沙海中，浅色的毛发与凉爽轻便的甲胄，往往意味着更多的生存机会。"],["/skins/1/acquisition_i18n/cn","外观商城购买可得该皮肤。"],["/skins/1/quality_i18n/cn","精英"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/0/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","偷懒？这叫合理安排"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/0/lines/1/text_i18n/cn","还有的是时间呢"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/1/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","噢，我要续杯！"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/2/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","哇噢，节日装饰！"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/3/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","节日有休假吧？"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/4/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","灯笼棒极了！"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/5/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","希望有节日加薪！"],["/affinity_tales/0/text_i18n/cn","活在当下是阿德的座右铭。他的另一句谚语是：早做准备。"],["/affinity_tales/1/text_i18n/cn","阿德也有失手的时刻。那时候，不反抗是最好的选择。"],["/affinity_tales/2/text_i18n/cn","阿德最喜欢吃肉排。但如果你愿意请他吃饭，那么他最喜欢吃白食。"],["/affinity_tales/3/text_i18n/cn","阿德其实有存款，但他不愿告诉别人。因为秘密是无法被掠夺的。"],["/affinity_tales/4/text_i18n/cn","阿德喜欢剪报。无论是新闻、笑话，或知识。"],["/affinity_tales/5/text_i18n/cn","逃过仇人的子弹时，阿德时常想，自己究竟是幸运，还是罪不至此？"],["/affinity_tales/6/text_i18n/cn","阿德的尾巴相当灵活，甚至可以执笔写字，和商户讨价还价时，他常趁主顾不注意时用尾巴篡改标价。"],["/affinity_tales/7/text_i18n/cn","曾有人委托阿德运送十块鸡翅，送到时，阿德宣称鸡翅运来的路上遭遇了强盗，自己勉力抢回五块。"],["/affinity_tales/8/text_i18n/cn","阿德偶尔也会回想起自己的家庭，父亲，还有父亲的谏言，但那些记忆在咸水镇的风沙中已经有些模糊。"],["/affinity_tales/9/text_i18n/cn","阿德也兼职做向导，小费给足，他会尽力保你平安。"],["/interaction_records/0/preview_i18n/cn","嘿，瓦尔克老兄！我猜你们坐在这里太过无聊，所以过来凑个热闹，还有位置吧？"],["/interaction_records/0/locales/cn","locales/cn/ep1/herohub_story/11412060.json"],["/interaction_records/0/title_i18n/cn","阿德 & 瓦尔克"],["/interaction_records/0/locations/0/name_i18n/cn","风蚀飞地"],["/interaction_records/0/locations/1/name_i18n/cn","深红高原"],["/interaction_records/1/preview_i18n/cn","等一下，你不能拿走我的水壶，那里面可是我从集市淘换来的好水，一点沙子都没掺。"],["/interaction_records/1/locales/cn","locales/cn/ep1/herohub_story/11412150.json"],["/interaction_records/1/title_i18n/cn","阿德 & 满满 & 瓦尔克 & 萨忒娜"],["/interaction_records/1/locations/0/name_i18n/cn","风蚀飞地"],["/interaction_records/1/locations/1/name_i18n/cn","深红高原"],["/interaction_records/2/preview_i18n/cn","哎呀，这些草药可怎么办呢。"],["/interaction_records/2/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415012.json"],["/interaction_records/2/title_i18n/cn","阿德 & 阿熏和蒙蒙"],["/interaction_records/3/preview_i18n/cn","偷懒？这叫合理安排"],["/interaction_records/3/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415090.json"],["/interaction_records/3/title_i18n/cn","阿德"],["/interaction_records/4/preview_i18n/cn","噢，我要续杯！"],["/interaction_records/4/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415091.json"],["/interaction_records/4/title_i18n/cn","阿德"],["/interaction_records/5/preview_i18n/cn","阿德，我的名字——很高兴认识你！"],["/interaction_records/5/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415326.json"],["/interaction_records/5/title_i18n/cn","阿德 & 卢卡"],["/interaction_records/6/preview_i18n/cn","哇噢，节日装饰！"],["/interaction_records/6/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415399.json"],["/interaction_records/6/title_i18n/cn","阿德"],["/interaction_records/7/preview_i18n/cn","节日有休假吧？"],["/interaction_records/7/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415400.json"],["/interaction_records/7/title_i18n/cn","阿德"],["/interaction_records/8/preview_i18n/cn","灯笼棒极了！"],["/interaction_records/8/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415571.json"],["/interaction_records/8/title_i18n/cn","阿德"],["/interaction_records/9/preview_i18n/cn","希望有节日加薪！"],["/interaction_records/9/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415572.json"],["/interaction_records/9/title_i18n/cn","阿德"]]}